<title>ISRAEL: Israel goes on daylight-saving time.</title>
<headline>Israel goes on daylight-saving time.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel went on daylight-saving time on Friday, moving its clocks forward one hour to GMT+three hours until September 13.</p>
</text>
